/Title (Q4. Explain the process of creating a basic line plot. ANS:- A line plot is used to represent continuous data and is very useful for showing trends and changes over time. It connects individual data points with straight lines, making it easy to observe increases or decreases. Creating a line plot involves importing the required library, preparing the dataset, plotting the values, and enhancing the graph with labels and titles for better understanding.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 275 0 R
/Next 409 0 R
>>
